---
description: Keep a px length the user states. Do not convert it through the 15px root.
alwaysApply: true
---

# Spacing units

When the user states a length in px, write that value as given. 32px stays `32px`.

Do not divide by the 15px root font size in `src/styles/styles.css`.

```css
/* stated as 32px */
margin-bottom: 32px;
```
